[A.]
<h2>Enter Hades Domain</h2>
<i>"You will rot here forever!"<br>
--King of Hades</i>  
<p>You have successfully lost to the Guardian or have been captured by the Bounties.  Either way you have now entered the Domain of Hades.<br>
You must fight for your rightful position here in Hades.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Congratulations on your victory!</h2>
<i>It appears that the King has a vacancy in his staff.</i>
<p>He has offered you the new Apprentice of Hades position.  Will you take it?  If you don't you will certainly die.<br>
If you do???  Continued............

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0

